            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/513e941e609a4b9cd98996d58a35dff1.avif?t=1768583824\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u012a\u023e \u0126\u023a\ua7a8 \u0243\u0246\u20b2\u0244\ua7a4. \u049e\u012a\u0141\u0141 \u023e\u0126\u0246\u16d7 \u023a\u0141\u0141.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set 2 years after the death of\u00a0<strong>G\u032b\u0310O\u0314\u0337\u0308\u0337\u0361\u035b\u0324\u031d\u030eD\u033a\u0362\u0365\u0328\u0333\u0337\u0339</strong> . A series of increasingly brutal murders has shaken what was once a small and peaceful Russian community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an entity that is able to possess its victim, and kill\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142 everyone that is in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by films like 'Uncut Gems' and 'The House that Jack Built', <strong>POSSESSOR</strong> is a 2D pixel art psychological thriller that features hand drawn animated cutscenes; accompanied with a very aggressive pacing and nihilistic writing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/0a7a7370060a8714072ae32b0c1f937f.poster.avif?t=1768583824\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/0a7a7370060a8714072ae32b0c1f937f.webm?t=1768583824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/0a7a7370060a8714072ae32b0c1f937f.mp4?t=1768583824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/e4beb09360036b25028effda5efc1027.avif?t=1768583824\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u20a6\u00d8\u20ae \u0246V\u0246\u20a6 \u20b1\u0142\u20b2\u20b4 \u20a9\u00d8\u0244\u2c60\u0110 \u20a3\u20b3\u20a9\u20a6 \u00d8V\u0246\u2c64 \u024e\u00d8\u0244.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A washed out 2D pixel art style with hand drawn animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click gameplay with logical puzzles, and a dynamic world that responds to your every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting soundtrack produced by Crowbait, Alan Otero, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After killing your victims, relive their memories through significant game genre changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight 2.5 hour experience that is written similarly to an edgy arthouse film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ad\u0142\u2c60\u2c60 \u20ae\u2c67\u0246\u20a5 \u20b3\u2c60\u2c60. \u20ae\u2c67\u0246\u2c64\u0246 \u0142\u20b4 \u20a6\u00d8 \u20b2\u00d8\u0110 \u20ae\u00d8 \u20b4\u20b3V\u0246 \u024e\u00d8\u0244.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/c2a7abede74fdfefb3e924b5af581a8c.poster.avif?t=1768583824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/c2a7abede74fdfefb3e924b5af581a8c.webm?t=1768583824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/c2a7abede74fdfefb3e924b5af581a8c.mp4?t=1768583824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055190/extras/513e941e609a4b9cd98996d58a35dff1.avif?t=1768583824\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u012a\u023e \u0126\u023a\ua7a8 \u0243\u0246\u20b2\u0244\ua7a4. \u049e\u012a\u0141\u0141 \u023e\u0126\u0246\u16d7 \u023a\u0141\u0141.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set 2 years after the death of\u00a0<strong>G\u032b\u0310O\u0314\u0337\u0308\u0337\u0361\u035b\u0324\u031d\u030eD\u033a\u0362\u0365\u0328\u0333\u0337\u0339</strong> . A series of increasingly brutal murders has shaken what was once a small and peaceful Russian community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an entity that is able to possess its victim, and kill\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142\u00a0\u2c65\ua7a5\u0111 \u049f\u012b\u0142\u0142 everyone that is in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by films like 'Uncut Gems' and 'The House that Jack Built', <strong>POSSESSOR</strong> is a 2D pixel art psychological thriller that features hand drawn animated cutscenes; accompanied with a very aggressive pacing and nihilistic writing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets